 "_about": "Reads  scratch_fx/eng7_opt_turn.txt   -- every em001 action's turn sites, emulated from 3U's own code (notes/options-3u.md 3)\nWrites MH3U-Monster-Viewer-HD/docs/turns.json   {<em>: {'<list>|Motion[N]': [row, ...]}, _about}, adding to the file\n\nA row: {action, rate, travel, when, rank, pitch}\n  rate    u16 per tick; the monster turns trunc(rate * 0.5 * speed) per motion frame toward the target's x/z (0x8357b0 / 0x8392d8,\n          snapping when closer than one step)\n  travel  the turn is the travel step's (0x843b80, travelStep flags 0) rather than a direct 0x8357b0 call\n  when    null = every frame of the motion; {mode, a, b, not}: the frame test the site sits behind -- mode 1 a: frame >= a,\n          mode 2 a: the last -a frames, mode 3 a b: a <= frame < b (modes 1-3 INFERRED from the test routine's arguments, mode 0\n          READ); not = the turn runs while the test is false\n  rank    {questRank: rate}: the rate at that quest rank and above (notes/options-3u.md 1: 7/17 / 7/78 at G -> 0x200)\n  pitch   {goal | aim, rate, add}: the body pitch the same action steps (0x696580 / 0x68ee54, notes/options-3u.md 3.1): a fixed\n          goal, or aimed at the target (atan2 of the height gap over the flat distance, positive when the target is below,\n          + add, clamped unsigned to 0x3000)\nA motion several actions play turns as its FIRST action in the file does (a viewer choice, as the effects' first listed action).",
